MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_160"}) ON CREATE SET number: "160", heading: "Return of goods bailed on expiration of time or accomplishment of purpose. It is the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "160. Return of goods bailed on expiration of time or accomplishment of purpose. It is the duty of the bailee to return, or deliver according to the bailor’s directions, the goods bailed, without deman";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_161"}) ON CREATE SET number: "161", heading: "Bailee’s responsibility when goods are not duly returned. If, by the default of the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "161. Bailee’s responsibility when goods are not duly returned. If, by the default of the bailee, the goods are not returned, delivered or tendered at the proper time, he is responsible to the bailor f";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_162"}) ON CREATE SET number: "162", heading: "Termination of gratuitous bailment by death. A gratuitous bailment is terminated by", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "162. Termination of gratuitous bailment by death. A gratuitous bailment is terminated by the death either of the bailor or of the bailee.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_163"}) ON CREATE SET number: "163", heading: "Bailor entitled to increase or profit from goods bailed. In the absence of any contract", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "163. Bailor entitled to increase or profit from goods bailed. In the absence of any contract to the contrary, the bailee is bound to deliver to the bailor, or according to his directions, any increase";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_164"}) ON CREATE SET number: "164", heading: "Bailor’s responsibility to bailee. The bailor is responsible to the bailee for any loss", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "164. Bailor’s responsibility to bailee. The bailor is responsible to the bailee for any loss which the bailee may sustain by reason that the bailor was not entitled to make the bailment, or to receive";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_165"}) ON CREATE SET number: "165", heading: "Bailment by several joint owners. If several joint owners of goods bail them, the bailee", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "165. Bailment by several joint owners. If several joint owners of goods bail them, the bailee may deliver them back to, or according to the directions of, one joint owner without the consent of all, i";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_166"}) ON CREATE SET number: "166", heading: "Bailee not responsible on re-delivery to bailor without title. If the bailor has no title", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "166. Bailee not responsible on re-delivery to bailor without title. If the bailor has no title to the goods, and the bailee, in good faith, delivers them back to, or according to the directions of, th";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_167"}) ON CREATE SET number: "167", heading: "Right of third person claiming goods bailed. If a person, other than the bailor, claims", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "167. Right of third person claiming goods bailed. If a person, other than the bailor, claims goods bailed, he may apply to the Court to stop the delivery of the goods to the bailor, and to decide the ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_168"}) ON CREATE SET number: "168", heading: "Right of finder of goods; may sue for specific reward offered. The finder of goods", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "168. Right of finder of goods; may sue for specific reward offered. The finder of goods has no right to sue the owner for compensation for trouble and expense voluntarily incurred by him to preserve t";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_169"}) ON CREATE SET number: "169", heading: "When finder of thing commonly on sale may sell it. When a thing which is commonly", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "169. When finder of thing commonly on sale may sell it. When a thing which is commonly the subject of sale is lost, if the owner cannot with reasonable diligence be found, or if he refuses, upon deman";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_177"}) ON CREATE SET number: "177", heading: "Defaulting pawnors’ right to redeem. If a time is stipulated for the payment of the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "177. Defaulting pawnors’ right to redeem. If a time is stipulated for the payment of the debt, or performance of the promise, for which the pledge is made, and the pawnor makes default in payment of t";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_178"}) ON CREATE SET number: "178", heading: "Pledge by mercantile agent", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "178.  Pledge by mercantile agent";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_178a"}) ON CREATE SET number: "178A", heading: "Pledge by person in possession under voidable contract. When the pawnor has", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "178A. Pledge by person in possession under voidable contract. When the pawnor has obtained possession of the goods pledged by him under a contract voidable under section 19 or section 19A, but the con";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_179"}) ON CREATE SET number: "179", heading: "Pledge where pawnor has only a limited interest. Where a person pledges goods in", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "179. Pledge where pawnor has only a limited interest. Where a person pledges goods in which he has only a limited interest, the pledge is valid to the extent of that interest. Suits by Bailees or Bail";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_180"}) ON CREATE SET number: "180", heading: "Suit by bailor or bailee against wrongdoer. If a third person wrongfully deprives the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "180. Suit by bailor or bailee against wrongdoer. If a third person wrongfully deprives the bailee of the use or possession of the goods bailed, or does them any injury, the bailee is entitled to use s";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_181"}) ON CREATE SET number: "181", heading: "Apportionment of relief or compensation obtained by such suits. Whatever is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "181. Apportionment of relief or compensation obtained by such suits. Whatever is obtained by way of relief or compensation in any such suit shall, as between the bailor and the bailee, be dealt with a";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_183"}) ON CREATE SET number: "183", heading: "Who may employ agent. Any person who is of the age of majority according to the law", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "183. Who may employ agent. Any person who is of the age of majority according to the law to which he is subject, and who is of sound mind, may employ an agent.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_184"}) ON CREATE SET number: "184", heading: "Who may be an agent. As between the principal and third persons any person may", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "184. Who may be an agent. As between the principal and third persons any person may become an agent, but no person who is not of the age of majority and of sound mind can become an agent, so as to be ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_185"}) ON CREATE SET number: "185", heading: "Consideration not necessary. No consideration is necessary to create an agency", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "185. Consideration not necessary. No consideration is necessary to create an agency.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_186"}) ON CREATE SET number: "186", heading: "Agent’s authority may be expressed or implied. The authority of an agent may be", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "186. Agent’s authority may be expressed or implied. The authority of an agent may be expressed or implied.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_187"}) ON CREATE SET number: "187", heading: "Definitions of express and implied authority. An authority is said to be express when", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "187. Definitions of express and implied authority. An authority is said to be express when it is given by words spoken or written. An authority is said to be implied when it is to be inferred from the";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_188"}) ON CREATE SET number: "188", heading: "Extent of agent’s authority. An agent having an authority to do an act has authority to", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "188. Extent of agent’s authority. An agent having an authority to do an act has authority to do every lawful thing which is necessary in order to do such act. An agent having an authority to carry on ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_189"}) ON CREATE SET number: "189", heading: "Agent’s authority in an emergency. An agent has authority, in an emergency, to do all", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "189. Agent’s authority in an emergency. An agent has authority, in an emergency, to do all such acts for the purpose of protecting his principal from loss as would be done by a person of ordinary prud";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_190"}) ON CREATE SET number: "190", heading: "When agent cannot delegate. An agent cannot lawfully employ another to perform acts", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "190. When agent cannot delegate. An agent cannot lawfully employ another to perform acts which he has expressly or impliedly undertaken to perform personally, unless by the ordinary custom of trade a ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_192"}) ON CREATE SET number: "192", heading: "Representation of principal by sub-agent properly appointed. Where a sub-agent is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "192. Representation of principal by sub-agent properly appointed. Where a sub-agent is properly appointed, the principal is, so far as regards third persons, represented by the sub-agent, and is bound";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_193"}) ON CREATE SET number: "193", heading: "Agent’s responsibility for sub-agent appointed without authority. Where an agent,", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "193. Agent’s responsibility for sub-agent appointed without authority. Where an agent, without having authority to do so, has appointed a person to act as a sub-agent, the agent stands towards such pe";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_194"}) ON CREATE SET number: "194", heading: "Relation between principal and person duly appointed by agent to act in business", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "194. Relation between principal and person duly appointed by agent to act in business of agency. Where an agent, holding an express or implied authority to name another person to act for the principal";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_195"}) ON CREATE SET number: "195", heading: "Agent’s duty in naming such person. In selecting such agent for his principal, an agent", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "195. Agent’s duty in naming such person. In selecting such agent for his principal, an agent is bound to exercise the same amount of discretion as a man of ordinary prudence would exercise in his own ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_196"}) ON CREATE SET number: "196", heading: "Right of person as to acts done for him without his authority. Effect of ratification", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "196. Right of person as to acts done for him without his authority. Effect of ratification. Where acts are done by one person on behalf of another, but without his knowledge or authority, he may elect";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_197"}) ON CREATE SET number: "197", heading: "Ratification may be expressed or implied. Ratification may be expressed or may be", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "197. Ratification may be expressed or implied. Ratification may be expressed or may be implied in the conduct of the person on whose behalf the acts are done. Illustrations (a) A, without authority, b";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_198"}) ON CREATE SET number: "198", heading: "Knowledge requisite for valid ratification. No valid ratification can be made by a", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "198. Knowledge requisite for valid ratification. No valid ratification can be made by a person whose knowledge of the facts of the case is materially defective.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_199"}) ON CREATE SET number: "199", heading: "Effect of ratifying unauthorized act forming part of a transaction. A person", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "199. Effect of ratifying unauthorized act forming part of a transaction. A person ratifying any unauthorised act done on his behalf ratifies the whole of the transaction of which such act fromed a par";
