MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_201"}) ON CREATE SET number: "201", heading: "Termination of agency. An agency is terminated by the principal revoking his", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "201. Termination of agency. An agency is terminated by the principal revoking his authority; or by the agent renouncing the business of the agency; or by the business of the agency being completed ; o";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_202"}) ON CREATE SET number: "202", heading: "Termination of agency where agent has an interest in subject matter. Where the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "202. Termination of agency where agent has an interest in subject matter. Where the agent has himself an interest in the property which forms the subject-matter of the agency, the agency cannot, in th";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_203"}) ON CREATE SET number: "203", heading: "When principal may revoke agent’s authority. The principal may, save as is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "203. When principal may revoke agent’s authority. The principal may, save as is otherwise provided by the last preceding section, revoke the authority given to his agent at any time before the authori";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_204"}) ON CREATE SET number: "204", heading: "Revocation where authority has been partly exercised. The principal cannot revoke", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "204. Revocation where authority has been partly exercised. The principal cannot revoke the authority given to his agent after the authority has been partly exercised so far as regards such acts and ob";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_205"}) ON CREATE SET number: "205", heading: "Compensation for revocation by principal or renunciation by agent. Where there is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "205. Compensation for revocation by principal or renunciation by agent. Where there is an express or implied contract that the agency should be continued for any period of time, the principal must mak";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_206"}) ON CREATE SET number: "206", heading: "Notice of revocation or renunciation. Reasonable notice must be given of such", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "206. Notice of revocation or renunciation. Reasonable notice must be given of such revocation or renunciation; otherwise the damage thereby resulting to the principal or the agent, as the case may be,";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_207"}) ON CREATE SET number: "207", heading: "Revocation and renunciation may be expressed or implied. Revocation and", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "207. Revocation and renunciation may be expressed or implied. Revocation and renunciation may be expressed or may be implied in the conduct of the principal or agent respec- tively. Illustration A emp";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_208"}) ON CREATE SET number: "208", heading: "When termination of agent’s authority takes effect as to agent, and as to third", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "208. When termination of agent’s authority takes effect as to agent, and as to third persons. The termination of the authority of an agent does not, so far as regards the agent, take effect before it ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_209"}) ON CREATE SET number: "209", heading: "Agent’s duty on termination of agency by principal’s death or insanity. When an", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "209. Agent’s duty on termination of agency by principal’s death or insanity. When an agency is terminated by the principal dying or becoming of unsound mind, the agent is bound to take, on behalf of t";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_210"}) ON CREATE SET number: "210", heading: "Termination of sub-agent’s authority. The termination of the authority of an agent", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "210. Termination of sub-agent’s authority. The termination of the authority of an agent causes the termination (subject to the rules herein contained regarding the termination of an agent’s authority)";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_211"}) ON CREATE SET number: "211", heading: "Agent’s duty in conducting principal’s business. An agent is bound to conduct the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "211. Agent’s duty in conducting principal’s business. An agent is bound to conduct the business of his principal according to the directions given by the principal, or, in the absence of any such dire";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_212"}) ON CREATE SET number: "212", heading: "Skill and diligence required from agent. An agent is bound to conduct the business of", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "212. Skill and diligence required from agent. An agent is bound to conduct the business of the agency with as much skill as is generally possessed by persons engaged in similar business, unless the pr";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_213"}) ON CREATE SET number: "213", heading: "Agent’s accounts. An agent is bound to render proper accounts to his principal on", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "213. Agent’s accounts. An agent is bound to render proper accounts to his principal on demand.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_214"}) ON CREATE SET number: "214", heading: "Agent’s duty to communicate with principal. It is the duty of an agent, in cases of", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "214. Agent’s duty to communicate with principal. It is the duty of an agent, in cases of difficulty, to use all reasonable diligence in communicating with his principal, and in seeking to obtain his i";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_215"}) ON CREATE SET number: "215", heading: "Right of principal when agent deals, on his own account, in business of agency", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "215. Right of principal when agent deals, on his own account, in business of agency without principal’s consent. If an agent deals on his own account in the business of the agency, without first obtai";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_216"}) ON CREATE SET number: "216", heading: "Principal’s right to benefit gained by agent dealing on his own account in business", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "216. Principal’s right to benefit gained by agent dealing on his own account in business of agency. If an agent, without the knowledge of his principal, deals in the business of the agency on his own ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_217"}) ON CREATE SET number: "217", heading: "Agent’s right of retainer out of sums received on principal’s account. An agent may", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "217. Agent’s right of retainer out of sums received on principal’s account. An agent may retain, out of any sums received on account of the principal in the business of the agency, all moneys due to h";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_218"}) ON CREATE SET number: "218", heading: "Agent’s duty to pay sums received for principal. Subject to such deductions, the agent", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "218. Agent’s duty to pay sums received for principal. Subject to such deductions, the agent is bound to pay to his principal all sums received on his account.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_219"}) ON CREATE SET number: "219", heading: "When agent’s remuneration becomes due. In the absence of any special contract,", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "219. When agent’s remuneration becomes due. In the absence of any special contract, payment for the performance of any act is not due to the agent until the completion of such act; but an agent may de";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_220"}) ON CREATE SET number: "220", heading: "Agent not entitled to remuneration for business misconducted. An agent who is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "220. Agent not entitled to remuneration for business misconducted. An agent who is guilty of misconduct in the business of the agency is not entitled to any remuneration in respect of that part of the";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_221"}) ON CREATE SET number: "221", heading: "Agent’s lien on principal’s property. In the absence of any contract to the contrary, an", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "221. Agent’s lien on principal’s property. In the absence of any contract to the contrary, an agent is entitled to retain goods, papers and other property, whether moveable or immoveable, of the princ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_222"}) ON CREATE SET number: "222", heading: "Agent to be indemnified against consequences of lawful acts. The employer of an", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "222. Agent to be indemnified against consequences of lawful acts. The employer of an agent is bound to indemnify him against the consequences of all lawful acts done by such agent in exercise of the a";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_223"}) ON CREATE SET number: "223", heading: "Agent to be indemnified against consequences of acts done in good faith. Where one", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "223. Agent to be indemnified against consequences of acts done in good faith. Where one person employs another to do an act, and the agent does the act in good faith, the employer is liable to indemni";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_224"}) ON CREATE SET number: "224", heading: "Non-liability of employer of agent to do a criminal act. Where one person employs", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "224. Non-liability of employer of agent to do a criminal act. Where one person employs another to do an act which is criminal, the employer is not liable to the agent, either upon an express or an imp";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_225"}) ON CREATE SET number: "225", heading: "Compensation to agent for injury caused by principal’s neglect. The principal must", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "225. Compensation to agent for injury caused by principal’s neglect. The principal must make compensation to his agent in respect of injury caused to such agent by the principal’s neglect or want of s";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_226"}) ON CREATE SET number: "226", heading: "Enforcement and consequences of agent’s contracts. Contracts entered into through", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "226. Enforcement and consequences of agent’s contracts. Contracts entered into through an agent, and obligations arising from acts done by an agent, may be enforced in the same manner, and will have t";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_227"}) ON CREATE SET number: "227", heading: "Principal how far bound, when agent exceeds authority. When an agent does more", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "227. Principal how far bound, when agent exceeds authority. When an agent does more than he is authorized to do, and when the part of what he does, which is within his authority, can be separated from";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_228"}) ON CREATE SET number: "228", heading: "Principal not bound when excess of agent’s authority is not separable. Where an", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "228. Principal not bound when excess of agent’s authority is not separable. Where an agent does more than he is authorized to do, and what he does beyond the scope of his authority cannot be separated";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_229"}) ON CREATE SET number: "229", heading: "Consequences of notice given to agent. Any notice given to or information obtained by", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "229. Consequences of notice given to agent. Any notice given to or information obtained by the agent, provided it be given or obtained in the course of the business transacted by him for the principal";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_230"}) ON CREATE SET number: "230", heading: "Agent cannot personally enforce, nor be bound by, contracts on behalf of principal", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "230. Agent cannot personally enforce, nor be bound by, contracts on behalf of principal. In the absence of any contract to that effect, an agent cannot personally enforce contracts entered into by him";
