MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_1"}) ON CREATE SET number: "1", heading: "Short title. This Act may be called the 1[*] Contract Act, 1872", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "1. Short title. This Act may be called the 1[*] Contract Act, 1872. Extent and Commencement. It extends to 2[the whole of Pakistan]; and it shall come into force on the first day of September, 1872. E";
