MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_9"}) ON CREATE SET number: "9", heading: "Promises, express and implied. In so far as the proposal or acceptance of any promise is", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "9. Promises, express and implied. In so far as the proposal or acceptance of any promise is made in words, the promise is said to be express. In so far as such proposal or acceptance is made otherwise";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_10"}) ON CREATE SET number: "10", heading: "What agreements are contracts. All agreements are contracts if they are made by the", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "10. What agreements are contracts. All agreements are contracts if they are made by the free consent of parties competent to contract, for a lawful consideration and with a lawful object, and are not ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_11"}) ON CREATE SET number: "11", heading: "Who are competent to contract. Every person is competent to contract who is of the age", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "11. Who are competent to contract. Every person is competent to contract who is of the age of majority according to the law to which he is subject, and who is of sound mind, and is not disqualified fr";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_12"}) ON CREATE SET number: "12", heading: "What is a sound mind for the purposes of contracting. A person is said to be of sound", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "12. What is a sound mind for the purposes of contracting. A person is said to be of sound mind for the purpose of making a contract if, at the time when he makes it, he is capable of understanding it ";
