MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_21"}) ON CREATE SET number: "21", heading: "Effect of mistakes as to law. A contract is not voidable because it was caused by a", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "21. Effect of mistakes as to law. A contract is not voidable because it was caused by a mistake as to any law in force in 1[Pakistan]; but a mistake as to a law not in force in 1[Pakistan] has the sam";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_22"}) ON CREATE SET number: "22", heading: "Contract caused by mistake of one party as to matter of fact. A contract is not", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "22. Contract caused by mistake of one party as to matter of fact. A contract is not voidable merely because it was caused by one of the parties to it being under a mistake as to a matter of fact.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_23"}) ON CREATE SET number: "23", heading: "What considerations and objects are lawful and what not. The consideration or object", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "23. What considerations and objects are lawful and what not. The consideration or object of an agreement is lawful, unless—it is forbidden by law; or is of such a nature that, if permitted, it would d";
