MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_25"}) ON CREATE SET number: "25", heading: "Agreement without consideration void, unless it is in writing and registered, or is a", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "25. Agreement without consideration void, unless it is in writing and registered, or is a promise to compensate for something done, or is a promise to pay a debt barred by limitation law. An agreement";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_26"}) ON CREATE SET number: "26", heading: "Agreement in restraint of marriage void. Every agreement in restraint of the marriage", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "26. Agreement in restraint of marriage void. Every agreement in restraint of the marriage of any person, other than a minor, is void.";
