MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_28"}) ON CREATE SET number: "28", heading: "Agreements in restraint of legal proceedings void. Every agreement, by which any", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "28. Agreements in restraint of legal proceedings void. Every agreement, by which any party thereto is restricted absolutely from enforcing his rights under or in respect of any contract, by the usual ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_29"}) ON CREATE SET number: "29", heading: "Agreements void for uncertainty. Agreements, the meaning of which is not certain, or", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "29. Agreements void for uncertainty. Agreements, the meaning of which is not certain, or capable of being made certain, are void. Illustrations (a) A agrees to sell to B “a hundred tons of oil”. There";
