MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_71"}) ON CREATE SET number: "71", heading: "Responsibility of finder of goods. A person who finds goods belonging to another and", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "71. Responsibility of finder of goods. A person who finds goods belonging to another and takes them into his custody, is subject to the same responsibility as a bailee.";
