MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_75"}) ON CREATE SET number: "75", heading: "Party rightfully rescinding contract entitled to compensation. A person who rightly", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "75. Party rightfully rescinding contract entitled to compensation. A person who rightly rescinds a contract is entitled to compensation for any damage which he has sustained through the non-fulfilment";
