MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_004_128"}) ON CREATE SET number: "128", heading: "Surety’s liability. The liability of the surety is co-extensive with that of the principal", act_title: "Contract Act, 1872", act_id: "act_stat_004", text_preview: "128. Surety’s liability. The liability of the surety is co-extensive with that of the principal debtor, unless it is otherwise provided by the contract. Illustration A guarantees to B the payment of a";
