MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_154"}) ON CREATE SET number: "154", heading: "What matters may be proved in connection with proved statement relevant under", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "154. What matters may be proved in connection with proved statement relevant under Article 46 or 47.— Whenever any statement, relevant under Article 46 or 47, is proved, all matters may be proved eith";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_155"}) ON CREATE SET number: "155", heading: "Refreshing memory.—(1) A witness may, while under examination, refresh his memory", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "155. Refreshing memory.—(1) A witness may, while under examination, refresh his memory by referring to any writing made by himself at the time of the transaction concerning which he is questioned, or ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_156"}) ON CREATE SET number: "156", heading: "Testimony to facts stated in document mentioned in Article 155.— A witness may", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "156. Testimony to facts stated in document mentioned in Article 155.— A witness may also testify to facts mentioned in any such document as is mentioned in Article 155, although he has no specific rec";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_157"}) ON CREATE SET number: "157", heading: "Right of adverse party as to writing used to refresh memory.— Any writing referred", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "157. Right of adverse party as to writing used to refresh memory.— Any writing referred to under the provisions of the two last preceding Articles must be produced and shown to the adverse party if he";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_158"}) ON CREATE SET number: "158", heading: "Production of documents.—(1) A witness summoned to produce a document shall, if it", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "158. Production of documents.—(1) A witness summoned to produce a document shall, if it is in his possession or power, bring it to Court, notwithstanding any objection which there may be to its produc";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_159"}) ON CREATE SET number: "159", heading: "Giving, as evidence, of document called for and produced on notice.— When a party", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "159. Giving, as evidence, of document called for and produced on notice.— When a party calls for a document which he has given the other party notice to produce, and such document is produced and insp";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_160"}) ON CREATE SET number: "160", heading: "Using, as evidence, of document production of which was refused on notice.— When", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "160. Using, as evidence, of document production of which was refused on notice.— When a party refuses to produce a document which he has had notice to produce, he cannot afterwards use the document as";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_161"}) ON CREATE SET number: "161", heading: "Judge’s power to put questions or order production.— The Judge may, in order to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "161. Judge’s power to put questions or order production.— The Judge may, in order to discover or to obtain proper proof of relevant facts, ask any question he pleases, in any form, at any time, of any";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_162"}) ON CREATE SET number: "162", heading: "No new trial for improper admission or rejection of evidence.—The improper", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "162. No new trial for improper admission or rejection of evidence.—The improper admission or rejection of evidence shall not be ground of itself for a new trial or reversal of any decision in any case";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_163"}) ON CREATE SET number: "163", heading: "Acceptance or denial of claim on oath.—(1) When the plaintiff takes oath in support of", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "163. Acceptance or denial of claim on oath.—(1) When the plaintiff takes oath in support of his claim, the Court shall, on the application of the plaintiff, call upon the defendant to deny the claim o";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_164"}) ON CREATE SET number: "164", heading: "Production of evidence that has become available because of modern devices, etc", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "164.  Production of evidence that has become available because of modern devices, etc.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_165"}) ON CREATE SET number: "165", heading: "Order to override other laws.— The provisions of this Order shall have effect", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "165. Order to override other laws.— The provisions of this Order shall have effect notwithstanding anything contained in any other law for the time being in force.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_166"}) ON CREATE SET number: "166", heading: "Repeal.— The Evidence Act, 1872 (I of 1872), is hereby repealed", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "166. Repeal.— The Evidence Act, 1872 (I of 1872), is hereby repealed. ______________ RGN Dated. 08-01-2026 1Subs. by the XXXVII of 2023, s.12.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_1"}) ON CREATE SET number: "1", heading: "Short title, extent and commencement.—(1) This Order may be called the", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "1. Short title, extent and commencement.—(1) This Order may be called the Qanun-e-Shahadat, 1984. (2) It extends to the whole of Pakistan and applies to all judicial proceedings in or before any Court";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_2"}) ON CREATE SET number: "2", heading: "Interpretation.—(1) In this Order, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "2. Interpretation.—(1) In this Order, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,— (a) “Court” includes all Judges and Magistrates, and all persons, except arbitrators, legally autho";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_3"}) ON CREATE SET number: "3", heading: "Who may testify.— All persons shall be competent to testify unless the Court considers that", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "3. Who may testify.— All persons shall be competent to testify unless the Court considers that they are prevented from understanding the questions put to them, or from giving rational answers to those";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_4"}) ON CREATE SET number: "4", heading: "Judges and Magistrates.— No Judge or Magistrate shall, except upon the special order of", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "4. Judges and Magistrates.— No Judge or Magistrate shall, except upon the special order of some Court to which he is subordinate, be compelled to answer any questions as to his own conduct in Court as";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_5"}) ON CREATE SET number: "5", heading: "Communications during marriage.— No person who is or has been married shall be", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "5. Communications during marriage.— No person who is or has been married shall be compelled to disclose any communication made to him during marriage by any person to whom he is or has been married; n";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_6"}) ON CREATE SET number: "6", heading: "Evidence as to affairs of State.— No one shall be permitted to give any evidence derived", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "6. Evidence as to affairs of State.— No one shall be permitted to give any evidence derived from unpublished official records relating to any affairs of State, except with the permission of the office";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_7"}) ON CREATE SET number: "7", heading: "Official communications.— No public officer shall be compelled to disclose", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "7. Official communications.— No public officer shall be compelled to disclose communications made to him in official confidence, when he considers that the public interests would suffer by the disclos";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_8"}) ON CREATE SET number: "8", heading: "Information as to commission of offences.— No Magistrate or Police -officer shall be", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "8. Information as to commission of offences.— No Magistrate or Police -officer shall be compelled to say whence he got any information as to the commission of any offence, and no Revenue-officer shall";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_9"}) ON CREATE SET number: "9", heading: "Professional communications.— No advocate shall at any time be permitted, unless with", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "9. Professional communications.— No advocate shall at any time be permitted, unless with his client’s express consent, to disclose any communication made to him in the course and for the purpose of hi";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_10"}) ON CREATE SET number: "10", heading: "Article 9 to apply to interpreters, etc.— The provisions of Article 9 shall apply to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "10. Article 9 to apply to interpreters, etc.— The provisions of Article 9 shall apply to interpreters, and the clerks or servants of advocates.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_11"}) ON CREATE SET number: "11", heading: "Privilege not waived by volunteering evidence.— If any party to a suit gives evidence", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "11. Privilege not waived by volunteering evidence.— If any party to a suit gives evidence therein at his own instance or otherwise, he shall not be deemed to have consented thereby to such disclosure ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_12"}) ON CREATE SET number: "12", heading: "Confidential communications with legal advisers.— No one shall be compelled to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "12. Confidential communications with legal advisers.— No one shall be compelled to disclose to the Court, tribunal or other authority exercising judicial or quasi-judicial powers or jurisdiction any c";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_13"}) ON CREATE SET number: "13", heading: "Production of title deed of witness, not a party.— No witness who is not a party to a suit", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "13. Production of title deed of witness, not a party.— No witness who is not a party to a suit shall be compelled to produce his title deeds to any property or any document in virtue of which he holds";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_14"}) ON CREATE SET number: "14", heading: "Production of documents which another person, having possession, could refuse to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "14. Production of documents which another person, having possession, could refuse to produce.— No one shall be compelled to produce documents in his possession, which any other person would be entitle";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_15"}) ON CREATE SET number: "15", heading: "Witness not excused from answering on ground that answer will criminate.— A", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "15. Witness not excused from answering on ground that answer will criminate.— A witness shall not be excused from answering any question as to any matter relevant to the matter in issue in any suit or";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_16"}) ON CREATE SET number: "16", heading: "Accomplice.— An accomplice shall be a competent witness against an accused person,", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "16. Accomplice.— An accomplice shall be a competent witness against an accused person, except in the case of an offence punishable with hadd; and a conviction is not illegal merely because it proceeds";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_17"}) ON CREATE SET number: "17", heading: "Competence and number of witnesses. — (1) The competence of a person to testify, and", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "17. Competence and number of witnesses. — (1) The competence of a person to testify, and the number of witnesses required in any case shall be determined in accordance with the injunctions of Islam as";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_18"}) ON CREATE SET number: "18", heading: "Evidence may be given of facts in issue and relevant facts.— Evidence may be given in", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "18. Evidence may be given of facts in issue and relevant facts.— Evidence may be given in any suit or proceeding of the existence or non-existence of every fact in issue and of such other facts as are";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_19"}) ON CREATE SET number: "19", heading: "Relevancy of facts forming part of same transaction.— Facts which though not in issue,", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "19. Relevancy of facts forming part of same transaction.— Facts which though not in issue, are so connected with a fact in issue as to form part of the same transaction, are relevant, whether they occ";
