MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_21"}) ON CREATE SET number: "21", heading: "Motive, preparation and previous or subsequent conduct.— (1) Any fact is relevant", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "21. Motive, preparation and previous or subsequent conduct.— (1) Any fact is relevant which shows or constitutes a motive or preparation for any fact in issue or relevant fact. (2) The conduct of any ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_22"}) ON CREATE SET number: "22", heading: "Facts necessary to explain or introduce relevant facts.— Facts necessary to explain or", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "22. Facts necessary to explain or introduce relevant facts.— Facts necessary to explain or introduce a fact in issue or relevant fact, or which support or rebut an inference suggested by a fact in iss";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_23"}) ON CREATE SET number: "23", heading: "Things said or done by conspirator in reference to common design.— Where there is", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "23. Things said or done by conspirator in reference to common design.— Where there is reasonable ground to believe that two or more persons have conspired together to commit an offence or an actionabl";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_24"}) ON CREATE SET number: "24", heading: "When facts not otherwise relevant become relevant.— Facts not otherwise relevant are", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "24. When facts not otherwise relevant become relevant.— Facts not otherwise relevant are relevant— (1) if they are inconsistent with any fact in issue or relevant fact; (2)  If by themselves or in con";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_25"}) ON CREATE SET number: "25", heading: "In suits for damages facts tending to enable Court to determine amount are", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "25. In suits for damages facts tending to enable Court to determine amount are relevant.—In suits in which damages are claimed, any fact which will enable the court to determine the amount of damages ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_26"}) ON CREATE SET number: "26", heading: "Facts relevant when right or custom is in question.— Where the question is as to the", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "26. Facts relevant when right or custom is in question.— Where the question is as to the existence of any right or custom, the following facts are relevant: — (a) any transaction by which the right or";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_27"}) ON CREATE SET number: "27", heading: "Facts showing existence of state of mind, or of body, or bodily feeling.— Facts showing", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "27. Facts showing existence of state of mind, or of body, or bodily feeling.— Facts showing the existence of any state of mind, such as intention, knowledge, good faith, negligence, rashness, ill-will";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_28"}) ON CREATE SET number: "28", heading: "Facts bearing on question whether act was accidental or intentional.— When there is", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "28. Facts bearing on question whether act was accidental or intentional.— When there is a question whether an act was accidental or intentional, or done with a particular knowledge or intention, the f";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_29"}) ON CREATE SET number: "29", heading: "Existence of course of business when relevant.— When there is a question whether a", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "29. Existence of course of business when relevant.— When there is a question whether a particular act was done, the existence of any course of business, according to which it naturally would have been";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_30"}) ON CREATE SET number: "30", heading: "Admission defined.— An admission is a statement, oral or documentary, which suggests", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "30. Admission defined.— An admission is a statement, oral or documentary, which suggests any inference as to any fact in issue or relevant fact, and which is made by any of the persons, and under the ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_31"}) ON CREATE SET number: "31", heading: "Admission by party to proceeding or his agent, etc.—(1) Statements made by a party to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "31. Admission by party to proceeding or his agent, etc.—(1) Statements made by a party to the proceeding, or by an agent to any such party, whom the Court regards, under the circumstances of the case,";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_32"}) ON CREATE SET number: "32", heading: "Admission by persons whose position must be proved as against party to suit.—", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "32. Admission by persons whose position must be proved as against party to suit.— Statements made by persons, whose position or liability it is necessary to prove as against any party to the suit, are";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_33"}) ON CREATE SET number: "33", heading: "Admission by persons expressly referred to by party to suit.— Statements made by", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "33. Admission by persons expressly referred to by party to suit.— Statements made by persons to whom a party to the suit has expressly referred for information in reference to matter in dispute are ad";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_34"}) ON CREATE SET number: "34", heading: "Proof of admissions against persons making them, and by or on their behalf.—", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "34. Proof of admissions against persons making them, and by or on their behalf.— Admissions are relevant and may be proved as against the person who makes them, or his representative in interest; but ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_35"}) ON CREATE SET number: "35", heading: "When oral admissions as to contents of documents are relevant. — Oral admissions as", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "35. When oral admissions as to contents of documents are relevant. — Oral admissions as to the contents of a document are not relevant, unless and until the party proposing to prove them shows that he";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_36"}) ON CREATE SET number: "36", heading: "Admissions in civil cases when relevant.— In civil cases no admission is relevant, if it is", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "36. Admissions in civil cases when relevant.— In civil cases no admission is relevant, if it is made either upon an express condition that evidence of it is not to be given, or under circumstances fro";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_37"}) ON CREATE SET number: "37", heading: "Confession caused by inducement, threat or promise, when irrelevant in criminal", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "37. Confession caused by inducement, threat or promise, when irrelevant in criminal proceeding.— A confession made by an accused person is irrelevant in a criminal proceeding, if the making of the con";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_38"}) ON CREATE SET number: "38", heading: "Confession to police-officer not to be proved.— No confession made to a police-officer", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "38. Confession to police-officer not to be proved.— No confession made to a police-officer shall be proved as against a person accused of any offence.";
