MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_40"}) ON CREATE SET number: "40", heading: "How much of information received from accused may be proved.— When any fact is", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "40. How much of information received from accused may be proved.— When any fact is deposed to as discovered in consequence of information received from a person accused of any offence, in the custody ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_41"}) ON CREATE SET number: "41", heading: "Confession made after removal of impression caused by inducement, threat or", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "41. Confession made after removal of impression caused by inducement, threat or promise, relevant.— If such a confession as is referred to in Article 37 is made after the impression caused by any such";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_42"}) ON CREATE SET number: "42", heading: "Confession otherwise relevant not to become irrelevant because of promise of secrecy,", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "42. Confession otherwise relevant not to become irrelevant because of promise of secrecy, etc.— If such a confession is otherwise relevant, it does not become irrelevant merely because it was made und";
