MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_66"}) ON CREATE SET number: "66", heading: "In civil cases character to prove conduct imputed irrelevant.— In civil cases the fact", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "66. In civil cases character to prove conduct imputed irrelevant.— In civil cases the fact that the character of any person concerned is such as to render probable or improbable any conduct imputed to";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_67"}) ON CREATE SET number: "67", heading: "In criminal cases previous good character relevant.— In criminal proceedings the fact", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "67. In criminal cases previous good character relevant.— In criminal proceedings the fact that the person accused is of a good character is relevant.";
