MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_69"}) ON CREATE SET number: "69", heading: "Character as affecting damages.— In civil cases the fact that the character of any person", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "69. Character as affecting damages.— In civil cases the fact that the character of any person is such as to affect the amount of damages which he ought to receive, is relevant. Explanation:— In Articl";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_70"}) ON CREATE SET number: "70", heading: "Proof of facts by oral evidence.— All facts, except the contents of documents, may be", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "70. Proof of facts by oral evidence.— All facts, except the contents of documents, may be proved by oral evidence.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_71"}) ON CREATE SET number: "71", heading: "Oral evidence must be direct.— Oral evidence must, in all cases whatever be direct, that", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "71. Oral evidence must be direct.— Oral evidence must, in all cases whatever be direct, that is to say— If it refers to a fact which could be seen, it must be the evidence of a witness who says he saw";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_72"}) ON CREATE SET number: "72", heading: "Proof of contents of documents.— The contents of documents may be proved either by", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "72. Proof of contents of documents.— The contents of documents may be proved either by primary or by secondary evidence.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_73"}) ON CREATE SET number: "73", heading: "Primary evidence.— “Primary evidence” means the document itself produced for the", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "73. Primary evidence.— “Primary evidence” means the document itself produced for the inspection of the Court. Explanation 1.—Where a document is executed in several parts, each part is primary evidenc";
