MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_77"}) ON CREATE SET number: "77", heading: "Rules as to notice to produce.— Secondary evidence of the contents of the documents", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "77. Rules as to notice to produce.— Secondary evidence of the contents of the documents referred to in Article 76, paragraph (a), shall not be given unless the party proposing to give such secondary e";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_78"}) ON CREATE SET number: "78", heading: "Proof of signature and handwriting of person alleged to have signed or written", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "78. Proof of signature and handwriting of person alleged to have signed or written document produced.— If a document is alleged to be signed or to have been written wholly or in part by any person, th";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_79"}) ON CREATE SET number: "79", heading: "Proof of execution of document required by law to be attested.— If a document is", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "79. Proof of execution of document required by law to be attested.— If a document is required by law to be attested, it shall not be used as evidence until two attesting witnesses at least have been c";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_80"}) ON CREATE SET number: "80", heading: "Proof where no attesting witness found.— If no such attesting witness can be found, it", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "80. Proof where no attesting witness found.— If no such attesting witness can be found, it must be proved that the witnesses have either died, or cannot be found and that the document was executed by ";
