MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_82"}) ON CREATE SET number: "82", heading: "Proof when attesting witness denies the execution.— If the attesting witness denies or", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "82. Proof when attesting witness denies the execution.— If the attesting witness denies or does not recollect the execution of the document, its execution may be proved by other evidence.";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_83"}) ON CREATE SET number: "83", heading: "Proof of document not required by law to be attested.— An attested document not", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "83. Proof of document not required by law to be attested.— An attested document not required by law to be attested may be proved as if it was unattested.";
