MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_97"}) ON CREATE SET number: "97", heading: "Presumption as to books, maps and charts.— The Court may presume that any book to", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "97. Presumption as to books, maps and charts.— The Court may presume that any book to which it may refer for information on matters of public or general interest, and that any published map or chart, ";
MERGE (n:Section {id: "sec_stat_007_98"}) ON CREATE SET number: "98", heading: "Presumption as to telegraphic messages.— The Court may presume that message,", act_title: "Qanun-e-Shahadat Order, 1984", act_id: "act_stat_007", text_preview: "98. Presumption as to telegraphic messages.— The Court may presume that message, forwarded from a telegraph office to the person to whom such message purports to be addressed, corresponds with a messa";
